The MIT grant above covers Mappster's own code only. Mappster links against
third-party libraries under their own terms:

  DotRecast                zlib
  Silk.NET                 MIT
  ImGui.NET / Dear ImGui   MIT
  DBCD                     MIT

CascLib (https://github.com/WoW-Tools/CascLib) publishes no license at all, so
no copy of it appears in this repository. It is a git submodule: the build
fetches it from its own repository, and your use of it is between you and its
author. WoWDBDefs and the community listfile are likewise fetched, not shipped.

Mappster contains no Blizzard game data. It reads files from a World of Warcraft
installation you already have.
